S theorem Minidregg.Compiler.DurableLogTags.chainPrefixes_getElem? : ∀ (start : Minidregg.Theory.TypedAuthorization.Digest) (records : List Minidregg.Kernel.DurableReceiver.IntentRecord), ∀ i ≤ records.length, (Minidregg.Compiler.DurableLogTags.chainPrefixes start records)[i]? = Option.some (Minidregg.Compiler.DurableCheckpointCodec.chainAfter start (List.take i records))
