S theorem Minidregg.Kernel.HyperdocumentIndexSync.status_current_iff : ∀ {capacity : ℕ} (snapshot : Minidregg.Kernel.HyperdocumentIndexSync.Snapshot capacity), Minidregg.Kernel.HyperdocumentIndexSync.status snapshot = Minidregg.Kernel.HyperdocumentIndexSync.Status.current ↔ snapshot.Fresh
