S theorem Minidregg.Kernel.PresenceIndex.lastSeen_snoc : ∀ (log : List Minidregg.Kernel.DurableReceiver.IntentRecord) (record : Minidregg.Kernel.DurableReceiver.IntentRecord) (cell : Minidregg.Kernel.DurableDataIntent.CellId) (subject : Minidregg.Theory.TypedAuthorization.SubjectId), (Minidregg.Kernel.PresenceIndex.ofRecords (log ++ [record])).lastSeenAt cell subject = if Minidregg.Kernel.PresenceIndex.SignedWrite cell subject record then Option.some (log.length + 1) else (Minidregg.Kernel.PresenceIndex.ofRecords log).lastSeenAt cell subject
